    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"5a\"><p><strong>5a</strong></p><p> </p>\n<p>\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_05\"><img alt=\"Source markscheme diagram 5\" src=\"asset:fig_05\"/></figure>\n</p>\n<p> </p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"5b(i)\"><p><strong>5b(i)</strong></p><p></p>\n<p>Position labelled anywhere between P and B</p>\n<p></p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"5b(ii)\"><p><strong>5b(ii)</strong></p><p></p>\n<p>Arrow pointing to the right, labelled velocity.</p>\n<p>Arrow pointing to the left, labelled acceleration.</p>\n<p></p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"5c\"><p><strong>5c</strong></p><p> </p>\n<p>\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_06\"><img alt=\"Source markscheme diagram 6\" src=\"asset:fig_06\"/></figure>\n</p>\n<p> </p></section>"
