  "paper": "paper_2",
  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Initially, particle X is held at point A. When the particle is released at <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t = 0\"></span>, it oscillates with simple harmonic motion between points A and B. Point P is halfway between A and B. The time period of the oscillations is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span>.</p>\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n<p>a. Sketch how the acceleration of the particle varies with its displacement from point P.</p>\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_02\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 2\" src=\"asset:fig_02\"/></figure>\n<p>   [1]</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>b. On the diagram:</p>\n<p>i. label the approximate position of the particle at <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t = \\frac{11T}{8}\"></span> with the letter Y.</p>\n<p>   [1]</p>\n<p>ii. draw and label arrows to show the direction of the particle’s velocity and acceleration at <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t = \\frac{11T}{8}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>   [2]</p>\n<p>The graph shows how the displacement of the particle from point P varies with time.</p>\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_03\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 3\" src=\"asset:fig_03\"/></figure>\n<p>c. Sketch how the velocity of the particle varies with time.</p>\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_04\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 4\" src=\"asset:fig_04\"/></figure>\n<p>  [2]</p>"
  },
